{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05107","headline":"和户部岑尚书参迹枢揆 · 沈佺期","name":"和户部岑尚书参迹枢揆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君制六合，良佐参万机。\n大业永开泰，臣道日光辉。\n盐梅和鼎食，家声衆所归。\n汉章题楚劒，郑武袭缁衣。\n理识当朝远，文华振古希。\n风云神契合，舟檝道心微。\n庙堂喜容与，时物逓芳菲。\n御柳垂仙掖，公槐覆礼闱。\n昔陪鵷鹭後，今望鵾鹏飞。\n徒御清风颂，巴歌聊自挥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}